{"id":"t8672","key":"mein liebster feind klaus kinski|1999","csv":{"title":"Mein liebster Feind: Klaus Kinski","year":1999,"directors":["Werner Herzog"],"rating":6,"watchedDate":"2024-10-09"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":8672,"imdbId":"tt0200849","wikidataId":"Q592300","title":"Ennemis intimes","originalTitle":"Mein liebster Feind","altTitles":["My Best Fiend - Klaus Kinski","Meu melhor inimigo","Mein liebster Feind - Klaus Kinski","Min bäste ovän - Klaus Kinski","キンスキー、我が最愛の敵","Min beste fiende"],"tagline":"","overview":"Wernor Herzog a treize ans lorsque, par le plus grand des hasards, il se retrouve a Munich pendant quelques mois dans le même appartement que Klaus Kinski . Il se rend compte de la folie de Kinski lorsque celui-ci saccage l'appartement et sait donc à quoi s'en tenir lorsque, quelques années plus tard, il l'engage pour Aguirre, la colère de Dieu. Ennemis intimes retrace la relation passionnelle d'amour et de haine entre un réalisateur et son acteur fétiche.","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"1999-05-17","runtime":95,"status":"Released","genres":["Documentaire"],"genreIds":[99],"countries":["Germany","United Kingdom"],"originCountry":["DE"],"languages":["Deutsch","English","Español"],"originalLanguage":"de","directors":["Werner Herzog"],"directorIds":[6818],"writers":["Werner Herzog"],"composers":["Popol Vuh"],"cinematographers":["Peter Zeitlinger"],"editors":["Joe Bini"],"producers":["Sabine Rollberg","Lucki Stipetić"],"cast":[{"id":6818,"name":"Werner Herzog","character":"Self","profilePath":"/qKlz1oM482Xf0jTPfLiR6qXlLYK.jpg"},{"id":14277,"name":"Klaus Kinski","character":"Self (archive footage)","profilePath":"/twuyGlZJzJXFcbhVS2jlQOsTVFK.jpg"},{"id":4959,"name":"Claudia Cardinale","character":"Self","profilePath":"/gbTVdZGrOwteJ7qYSzyn8XpUk0H.jpg"},{"id":10627,"name":"Eva Mattes","character":"Self","profilePath":"/63ET2xZ3ezbDGKwXxz2eqwX0pxB.jpg"},{"id":1101334,"name":"Baron van der Recke","character":"Self","profilePath":null},{"id":2793370,"